  "description": "Empirical tabulation of per-Wedderburn-block binding fractions Δ_λ(K) for K ∈ {p, n, D, T, ³He, ⁴He} per the full ρ_K mass formula M(K) = m_e · Σ_λ y_λ · χ^λ · (1 + Δ_λ). Solves the underdetermined Σ c_λ Δ_λ = ΔM/m_e under four ansätze: (a) single-block sweep, (b) padded-staircase-supported, (c) Δ-monotonic via content sum c(λ), (d) Δ-isotypic via dim_q(λ)/[n]_q!. Reports best λ* per ansatz, ‖Δ‖₂, and cross-atom recurrence pattern. Mixed-precision: tier-2 chi data is float64 (numpy), per-ansatz solutions are mpmath. Proposal 1 of docs/audits/2026-05-09-workplan-update-rho-k.md. **Class-A audit-only**: consumes CODATA m_p, m_n as fit targets per the docstring banner; the emitted Δ_λ values are *fitted to CODATA*, not predicted from substrate. Tracked under Workplan-0b for substrate-pure replacement.",
